                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Beauty Essentials</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Discover thoughtfully selected makeup, skincare and fragrance for every routine</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Everyday Beauty Favorites</h2>\n<p>Find the products that make your routine feel personal. From easy-to-wear makeup to nourishing skincare, explore trusted essentials and standout favorites for every day.</p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Makeup for every mood and occasion</li>\n    <li>Skincare to support your daily routine</li>\n    <li>Fragrance and beauty favorites to make your own</li>\n</ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-teaser",
              "position": 2,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Find Your Feel-Good Favorites</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><i>Explore color, care and fragrance chosen to celebrate every skin tone and personal style</i></p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-two-column",
              "position": 3,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Makeup &amp; Color</h3>\n<p>From lipsticks and eyeshadow palettes to foundations and nail polish, discover versatile shades and statement-making finishes to express your style.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Skincare &amp; Fragrance</h3>\n<p>Build a routine with thoughtful skincare and find a fragrance that feels like you. Explore favorites for everyday care, special moments and everything in between.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "html",
              "position": 4,
