                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Makeup Made to Make a Statement</h2>\n<p>Explore lipsticks, eyeshadow palettes and foundations for looks that feel entirely your own. From everyday essentials to bold color, find favorites for every occasion.</p>\n<p>Thoughtfully selected shades make it easy to create a routine that feels like you.</p>"
