                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Skincare Worth Looking Forward To</h2>\n<p>Build a feel-good routine with luxury skincare selected for everyday care. Find considered essentials to complement your beauty rituals.</p>\n<p>Pair your skincare favorites with makeup and fragrance to make each day your own.</p>"
