                  "textContent": "<div style=\"padding: 60px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: white; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">Your Beauty, Your Way</h2>\n<p style=\"color: white; text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">Discover premium makeup, skincare and fragrance, from everyday essentials to statement-making favorites. Find new ways to celebrate your skin tone and personal style.</p>\n</div>"
