                  "textContent": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 2.5em; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Beauty Essentials</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 1.2em; color: #666; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">Discover thoughtfully selected makeup, skincare and fragrance for every routine and personal style.</p>"
