              "type": "text-two-column",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Beauty Favorites</h2>\n<p>Explore beauty essentials chosen to inspire your routine, from everyday staples to standout looks:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Makeup</strong> - Lipsticks, foundations and eyeshadow palettes</li>\n<li><strong>Skincare</strong> - Luxury essentials for your daily routine</li>\n<li><strong>Fragrance</strong> - Scents for every mood and occasion</li>\n<li><strong>Nail Color</strong> - Polish to finish or refresh your look</li>\n<li><strong>Everyday Staples</strong> - Reliable favorites for getting ready</li>\n<li><strong>Statement Picks</strong> - Products that celebrate personal style</li>\n</ul>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Find Your Favorites</h2>\n<p>Explore beauty products and options to find the right fit for your routine:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Lipstick</strong> - Shades and finishes for every look</li>\n<li><strong>Foundation</strong> - Options designed to celebrate every skin tone</li>\n<li><strong>Eyeshadow Palette</strong> - Colors for subtle or statement-making looks</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 16px; color: #666;\">Browse each category to discover makeup, skincare and fragrance favorites.</p>"
